Package: idepGolemDev
Title: iDEP Electron Shell Diagnostic
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("iDEP", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "dev@idep.local")
Description: A minimal Golem-shaped Shiny app used to exercise the iDEP
    Electron shell end to end (R spawn, HMAC handshake, env-var passing,
    port detection, window load) without requiring the full ~355-package
    iDEP runtime. Intended for local Electron development only — not
    shipped to end users.
